                default_layer {
                        display-name = "MAIN";
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// |  GUI |   ~  |  Q  |  W  |  E  |  R  |  T  |   |  Y  |  U   |  I  |  O  |  P  |  [   | GUI/] |
